{
  "info": {
    "name": "Torii AI Agents API Testing - 2 Phases",
    "description": "Postman collection for testing all 15 AI agent features (6 Sensei + 4 Assessment + 5 Analytics) in 2 phases:\n\nPHASE 1: Direct FastMCP Server Testing (Port 3333)\nPHASE 2: Full Stack Testing via NestJS (Port 8090)\n\nSwitch between phases by changing the 'phase' variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "phase",
      "value": "phase2",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Switch between 'phase1' (FastMCP direct: 3333) or 'phase2' (NestJS: 8090)"
    },
    {
      "key": "phase1_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3333/api",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "FastMCP Server (Direct)"
    },
    {
      "key": "phase2_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090/agents",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "NestJS Agents Service (Full Stack)"
    },
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "{{phase2_url}}",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Current active URL - change 'phase' variable to switch"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_user_id",
      "value": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "test_id",
      "value": "test-123",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📖 README - How to Use",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Instructions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "**HOW TO TEST 2 PHASES:**\n\n**PHASE 1 - Direct FastMCP Server (Port 3333):**\n1. Set variable 'phase' = 'phase1'\n2. Set 'base_url' = '{{phase1_url}}'\n3. Start FastMCP: `cd apps/server/modules/agents/mcp-server && pnpm dev`\n4. Test all endpoints in 'PHASE 1' folder\n\n**PHASE 2 - Full Stack NestJS (Port 8090):**\n1. Set variable 'phase' = 'phase2'\n2. Set 'base_url' = '{{phase2_url}}'\n3. Start FastMCP: `cd apps/server/modules/agents/mcp-server && pnpm dev`\n4. Start NestJS: `cd apps/server && npm run dev:agents`\n5. Test all endpoints in 'PHASE 2' folder\n\n**Architecture:**\n- Phase 1: Client → FastMCP (3333) → Gemini\n- Phase 2: Client → NestJS (8090) → FastMCP (3333) → Gemini\n\n**Expected Results: 15/15 passing in both phases**"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
